				<wikidot:authorName>Kakroom</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2198340</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Baldr. Who he used the latter's blind brother to kill, and then dressed up like a woman to prevent the latter from getting resurrected.</p> <p>He does get on to a ship with a bunch of monsters and sails to Vigrid. He also has sex with a giantess who gives birth to Fenrir, who bites off Tyr's hand and eventually kills Odin before being killed in turn by Vidar. I don't remember there being a specific trigger for Ragnarok other than 'it happens.'</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
