					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This is going to be as much fun as a Candle Cove marathon.</p> <p>Bobble always made me think about how folkloric trickster gods were actually terrifying elemental forces of chaos wearing smiley faces. I once read a description of Loki as 'mischievous'. Yeah, that's an accurate description.</p> 
				 	]]>
